    <string name="terminow_ubuntu_setup_title">Ubuntu setup</string>
    <string name="terminow_ubuntu_setup_intro">TermiNow prepares its own environment if it is not ready yet, installs proot-distro if needed, then uses the Ubuntu that is installed already or downloads the pinned Ubuntu release (checked with its SHA-256), and checks that it works. Nothing that exists is deleted.</string>
